    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;be a root of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br />where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mo>&#183;</mo></mfenced></math>&nbsp;denotes greatest integer function, is",
